# 💰 Personal Financial Command Center

An AI-powered financial dashboard built as part of the **ABTalks 60-Day Coding Challenge – Day 42**.

## 📌 Overview

Personal Financial Command Center is a premium single-page web application that helps users understand, organize, and improve their financial health through interactive visualizations and AI-inspired insights.

Instead of being just an expense tracker, it acts as a complete financial management platform with budgeting, savings, investments, cash flow analysis, goal tracking, and financial health scoring.

---

